/*  hole-11-87637.cufe: the model says some run reaches freed memory; `check` accepts it.
    chance true: CRASH 0xc0000005; chance false: CRASH 0xc0000005  */

Define chance as true permanently.
Bind void to f0:
    Define v1 as a series of series of number.
    v1 becomes v1.
Done.
Bind series of number to f1, given (the series of number p0, the series of number p1):
    Pull a rabbit.
        Cast f0 on ().
    Done.
    p0 becomes a series of number.
    Return p0.
Done.
Cast f0 on ().
Define v2 as a series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    v2 becomes cast f1 on (v2, v2).
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State v2.
